  {
    "id": "anno-fukuyama_upper_p221_left-18",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但シ該藩書上書甚タ混雜不分明而シテ終リノ一紙明白ニ之ヲ記ス故ニ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、該藩の書上書は甚だ混雑して不分明であり、終わりの一紙に明白にこれを記しているので"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "However, the written report submitted by this domain is extremely jumbled and unclear, and because the final sheet records these figures plainly,"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但書 該藩書上書混雜"
      }
